5,"Mixtec, Ixtayutla language. Evangelism tools, church planting ...",https://globalrecordings.net/en/language/vmj,"Audio recordings available in Mixtec, Ixtayutla These recordings are designed for evangelism and basic Bible teaching to bring the gospel message to people who are not literate or are from oral cultures, particularly unreached people groups.","Mixtec, Ixtayutla",Otomanguean
