9,(PDF) Penner 2019. Prosodic structure in Ixtayutla Mixtec: Evidence for the foot,https://www.academia.edu/38317368/Penner_2019_Prosodic_structure_in_Ixtayutla_Mixtec_Evidence_for_the_foot,"January 1, 2019 - Cross-linguistically, the foot is integrally connected to stress assignment, has a small inventory of basic shapes, plays an important templatic function in the synchronic and diachronic phonology of many languages and provides the domain for phonological rules and phonotactic generalizations. In this dissertation I show that the couplet in Ixtayutla Mixtec (IM), an underdescribed Mixtec variety spoken in Oaxaca, Mexico has all of these properties of the foot.","Mixtec, Ixtayutla",Otomanguean
